if exists(select 1 from public.dsa_problems where id='cx-candidate-key-reuse' and description is distinct from 'Return registration_number and campus_count for local registration numbers occurring in more than one distinct campus. This shows why the number alone need not identify a student.

**MySQL dialect.**

```sql
