if exists(select 1 from public.dsa_problems where id='cx-cardinality-course-counts' and description is distinct from 'For every course return course_id, attempt_count and student_count. Each enrollment row is an attempt; repeated attempts by one student count separately only in attempt_count. Include empty courses with zero counts.

**MySQL dialect.**

