- [MySQL 8.4 CHECK constraints](https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/create-table-check-constraints.html)
- [PostgreSQL 18 CREATE TABLE](https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/sql-createtable.html)' or heading is distinct from 'Column Constraints');
