if exists(select 1 from public.dsa_problems where id='cx-create-database-lab' and description is distinct from 'In an authorized administrative lab, create database cx_dbms_lab_catalog if absent, with utf8mb4 and utf8mb4_unicode_ci defaults. Create TEMPORARY table cx_dbms_lab_catalog.copied_labels(label VARCHAR(40) NOT NULL), copy labels from supplied lab_labels, and return database_name, character_set_name, collation_name and label_count. The database is initially absent or already has those exact defaults. Do not execute this against application databases.

**MySQL dialect.**

```sql
CREATE TABLE lab_labels (label VARCHAR(40) NOT NULL);
