if exists(select 1 from public.dsa_problems where id='cx-create-schema-synonym' and description is distinct from 'In an authorized disposable lab, use CREATE SCHEMA IF NOT EXISTS for cx_dbms_lab_admissions with utf8mb4 and utf8mb4_unicode_ci defaults. Return schema_name, character_set_name and collation_name from the actual catalog for that fixed target. The supplied expected_defaults row describes the intended comparison contract. Existing lab target, if present, already has those defaults.

**MySQL dialect.**

