**MySQL dialect.**

```sql
CREATE TABLE supplies (product_id INT PRIMARY KEY, product_code VARCHAR(12) NOT NULL, product_name VARCHAR(40) NOT NULL, unit_price DECIMAL(8,2) NOT NULL CHECK (unit_price >= 0), stock_qty INT NULL CHECK (stock_qty >= 0)) DEFAULT CHARACTER SET utf8mb4;
