- Empty input still needs an altered definition
- Original key and nonnegative constraint remain effective') then raise exception 'New coding ID already has other content: %', 'dsa-dbms-sql-ddl-alter-equipment'; end if;
insert into public.dsa_problems (id,topic_id,title,difficulty,slug,description,examples,test_cases,constraints,hints,starter_code,editorial,solution_code,solution_approach,supported_languages,sql_schema_sql,sql_seed_sql,learning_topic_id,status,is_premium,show_on_website,show_on_mobile,sort_order) select 'dsa-dbms-sql-ddl-alter-equipment',null::text,'Extend equipment with an optional inspection date','Medium','ddl-alter-equipment','The temporary equipment table already contains the fixture rows. Add inspected_on DATE NULL with ALTER TABLE. Set inspected_on to 2026-09-01 for rows with quantity > 0, leaving zero-quantity rows unrecorded. Return item_id, item_name, quantity, inspected_on ordered by item_id. Do not recreate the table or change identifiers.

**MySQL dialect.**

```sql
CREATE TEMPORARY TABLE equipment (item_id INT PRIMARY KEY, item_name VARCHAR(40) NOT NULL, quantity INT NOT NULL CHECK (quantity >= 0)) ENGINE=InnoDB;
INSERT INTO equipment VALUES (2,''Tripod'',0),(1,''Camera'',3);
```

**Required ordering:** item_id ascending

**Edge cases:**
- Zero quantity keeps NULL
- Empty input still needs an altered definition
- Original key and nonnegative constraint remain effective','[{"input": "INSERT INTO equipment VALUES (2,''Tripod'',0),(1,''Camera'',3);", "output": "item_id\titem_name\tquantity\tinspected_on\n1\tCamera\t3\t2026-09-01\n2\tTripod\t0\tNULL", "explanation": "The alteration adds a nullable calendar fact while retaining identity and existing validity rules. The targeted update leaves unrecorded dates distinct from the chosen inspection date."}]'::jsonb,'[{"seed_sql": "", "expected": "", "hidden": true}, {"seed_sql": "INSERT INTO equipment VALUES (5,''Mic'',0),(3,''Screen'',1);", "expected": "item_id\titem_name\tquantity\tinspected_on\n3\tScreen\t1\t2026-09-01\n5\tMic\t0\tNULL", "hidden": true}]'::jsonb,'["Preserve the original table and rows", "The new DATE column permits NULL", "Existing quantity constraints remain"]'::jsonb,'["Use ADD COLUMN on the existing table", "Populate only the stated positive-quantity rows"]'::jsonb,'{"sql": "-- ALTER the temporary table, populate dates, then SELECT.\n"}'::jsonb,'The alteration adds a nullable calendar fact while retaining identity and existing validity rules. The targeted update leaves unrecorded dates distinct from the chosen inspection date.','{"sql": "ALTER TABLE equipment ADD COLUMN inspected_on DATE NULL;\nUPDATE equipment SET inspected_on = ''2026-09-01'' WHERE quantity > 0;\nSELECT item_id,item_name,quantity,inspected_on FROM equipment ORDER BY item_id;"}'::jsonb,'The alteration adds a nullable calendar fact while retaining identity and existing validity rules. The targeted update leaves unrecorded dates distinct from the chosen inspection date.',array['sql'],'CREATE TEMPORARY TABLE equipment (item_id INT PRIMARY KEY, item_name VARCHAR(40) NOT NULL, quantity INT NOT NULL CHECK (quantity >= 0)) ENGINE=InnoDB;','INSERT INTO equipment VALUES (2,''Tripod'',0),(1,''Camera'',3);',topic_uuid,parent.status,parent.is_premium,parent.show_on_website,parent.show_on_mobile,1 from public.practice_tests parent where parent.id='pt-dbms-sql-8-ddl' on conflict(id) do nothing;
