**MySQL dialect.**

```sql
CREATE TABLE students (student_id INT PRIMARY KEY, birth_date DATE NULL);
INSERT INTO students VALUES (1,''1990-01-01''),(2,''2000-01-02''),(3,NULL),(4,''2026-01-02'');
```

**Required ordering:** Ascending student_id.

