if exists(select 1 from public.dsa_problems where id='cx-division-explicit-universe' and description is distinct from 'Return student_id for every student who has a completion for every required course. Use the students table as the entire candidate universe. Empty requirements qualify every student, including those without completions. Extra courses do not disqualify anyone.

