- [MySQL 8.4 AUTO_INCREMENT](https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/example-auto-increment.html)',heading='Identity Columns',updated_at=now() where topic_id=topic_uuid and metadata->>'source'='dbms_sql_tutorial_seed' and (body is distinct from '## Automatic generation supplies an identifier value

