**MySQL dialect.**

```sql
CREATE TABLE proposals (proposal_id INT PRIMARY KEY, institutional_number VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL);
INSERT INTO proposals VALUES (1,''S17''),(2,''S17''),(3,''S24''),(4,''S30''),(5,''S30''),(6,''S30'');
```

**Required ordering:** Ascending institutional_number.

**Edge cases:**
- Three conflicting proposals must count as three.
- No repeated numbers gives an empty audit.','[{"input": "INSERT INTO proposals VALUES (1,''S17''),(2,''S17''),(3,''S24''),(4,''S30''),(5,''S30''),(6,''S30'');", "output": "institutional_number\tproposal_count\nS17\t2\nS30\t3", "explanation": "The audit detects current conflicts. An enforced constraint is still needed to protect future accepted data."}]'::jsonb,'[{"seed_sql": "INSERT INTO proposals VALUES (1,''S1''),(2,''S2'');", "expected": "", "hidden": true}, {"seed_sql": "INSERT INTO proposals VALUES (9,''S1''),(2,''S1'');", "expected": "institutional_number\tproposal_count\nS1\t2", "hidden": true}]'::jsonb,'["All fixture codes use uppercase canonical spellings with no collation-sensitive differences."]'::jsonb,'["Group by the proposed alternate identity.", "Use HAVING to select conflicting group counts."]'::jsonb,'{"sql": "-- Write your SELECT query here\n"}'::jsonb,'The audit detects current conflicts. An enforced constraint is still needed to protect future accepted data.','{"sql": "SELECT institutional_number, COUNT(*) AS proposal_count FROM proposals GROUP BY institutional_number HAVING COUNT(*) > 1 ORDER BY institutional_number;"}'::jsonb,'The audit detects current conflicts. An enforced constraint is still needed to protect future accepted data.',array['sql'],'CREATE TABLE proposals (proposal_id INT PRIMARY KEY, institutional_number VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL);','INSERT INTO proposals VALUES (1,''S17''),(2,''S17''),(3,''S24''),(4,''S30''),(5,''S30''),(6,''S30'');',topic_uuid,parent.status,parent.is_premium,parent.show_on_website,parent.show_on_mobile,0 from public.practice_tests parent where parent.id='pt-dbms-sql-4-keys-in-the-relational-model' on conflict(id) do nothing;
