if exists(select 1 from public.dsa_problems where id='dsa-dbms-sql-logical-independence-split' and description is distinct from 'Return student_id, name, dept_id, marks after department facts move to student_departments. Keep every student, including those without an assignment. The old read contract permits a NULL dept_id. Score still means the former marks. Order by student_id.

**MySQL dialect.**

```sql
