**MySQL dialect.**

```sql
CREATE TABLE customers (customer_id INT PRIMARY KEY, customer_name VARCHAR(40) NOT NULL, reward_points INT NOT NULL CHECK(reward_points>=0));
CREATE TABLE premium_customers (customer_id INT PRIMARY KEY, customer_name VARCHAR(40) NOT NULL, reward_points INT NOT NULL CHECK(reward_points>=0), tier VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL);
INSERT INTO customers VALUES (10,''Noor'',5),(30,''Dev'',0); INSERT INTO premium_customers VALUES (20,''Mira'',8,''gold'');
```

**Required ordering:** customer_id ascending, source_kind ascending

**Edge cases:**
- Same local ID can exist in both sources
- An empty source does not hide the other
- Equal labels do not merge rows') then raise exception 'New coding ID already has other content: %', 'dsa-dbms-sql-or-combined-population'; end if;
