if exists(select 1 from public.dsa_problems where id='cx-participation-parent-gap' and description is distinct from 'Under a proposed policy that every department should have at least one course proposal referring to it, return department_id for departments with no matching proposal. This is a snapshot audit, not an enforcement mechanism. Ignore unassigned and invalid-reference proposals.

**MySQL dialect.**

```sql
