ling while preserving all original sample results and source setup. Native FK enforcement remains unverified.','{"sql": "SELECT e.id, e.name, e.department_id FROM employees e LEFT JOIN departments d ON d.id = e.department_id WHERE e.department_id IS NOT NULL AND d.id IS NULL ORDER BY e.id;"}'::jsonb,'The added nonmissing-reference predicate corrects optional-reference handling while preserving all original sample results and source setup. Native FK enforcement remains unverified.',array['sql'],'CREATE TABLE departments (
