if exists(select 1 from public.dsa_problems where id='cx-relational-integrity-audit' and description is distinct from 'Return proposal_id for proposals with a missing score or a score outside the inclusive 0-to-100 domain. Keep every invalid proposal identity.

**MySQL dialect.**

```sql
