**MySQL dialect.**

```sql
CREATE TABLE teaching_assignments (faculty_id INT NOT NULL, course_id INT NOT NULL, semester_id INT NOT NULL, PRIMARY KEY(faculty_id,course_id,semester_id));
INSERT INTO teaching_assignments VALUES (1,10,100),(1,20,200),(2,10,200),(1,30,200);
```

**Required ordering:** Ascending course_id.

**Edge cases:**
- A matching faculty-course pair in another semester is not enough.
- The requested faculty can teach several courses in one semester.','[{"input": "INSERT INTO teaching_assignments VALUES (1,10,100),(1,20,200),(2,10,200),(1,30,200);", "output": "faculty_id\tcourse_id\tsemester_id\n1\t20\t200\n1\t30\t200", "explanation": "The query retains the intended joint facts rather than treating individual pair appearances as proof of a complete assignment."}]'::jsonb,'[{"seed_sql": "INSERT INTO teaching_assignments VALUES (1,10,100),(2,10,200);", "expected": "", "hidden": true}, {"seed_sql": "INSERT INTO teaching_assignments VALUES (1,10,200);", "expected": "faculty_id\tcourse_id\tsemester_id\n1\t10\t200", "hidden": true}]'::jsonb,'["Each stored triple is a distinct joint assignment; participant existence is assumed in these temporary fixtures."]'::jsonb,'["Filter both requested participant roles.", "Keep all three identifying roles in the result."]'::jsonb,'{"sql": "-- Write your SELECT query here\n"}'::jsonb,'The query retains the intended joint facts rather than treating individual pair appearances as proof of a complete assignment.','{"sql": "SELECT faculty_id, course_id, semester_id FROM teaching_assignments WHERE faculty_id = 1 AND semester_id = 200 ORDER BY course_id;"}'::jsonb,'The query retains the intended joint facts rather than treating individual pair appearances as proof of a complete assignment.',array['sql'],'CREATE TABLE teaching_assignments (faculty_id INT NOT NULL, course_id INT NOT NULL, semester_id INT NOT NULL, PRIMARY KEY(faculty_id,course_id,semester_id));','INSERT INTO teaching_assignments VALUES (1,10,100),(1,20,200),(2,10,200),(1,30,200);',topic_uuid,parent.status,parent.is_premium,parent.show_on_website,parent.show_on_mobile,0 from public.practice_tests parent where parent.id='pt-dbms-sql-6-relationship-degree' on conflict(id) do nothing;
