**Required ordering:** Ascending department_id, position.

**Edge cases:**
- Equal scores use the student id tie-breaker.
- A one-row partition returns only one row.','[{"input": "INSERT INTO results VALUES (1,10,90),(2,10,90),(3,10,80),(4,20,70),(5,30,50),(6,30,60),(7,30,55);", "output": "department_id\tstudent_id\tscore\tposition\n10\t1\t90\t1\n10\t2\t90\t2\n20\t4\t70\t1\n30\t6\t60\t1\n30\t7\t55\t2", "explanation": "The unique identifier resolves ties for fixed row positions, while the partition restarts selection for each represented department."}]'::jsonb,'[{"seed_sql": "INSERT INTO results VALUES (9,10,80),(2,10,80),(7,10,80);", "expected": "department_id\tstudent_id\tscore\tposition\n10\t2\t80\t1\n10\t7\t80\t2", "hidden": true}, {"seed_sql": "", "expected": "", "hidden": true}]'::jsonb,'["Every student has one source result; scores are nonmissing integers.", "Output fixtures check results; source review is needed to enforce the requested window technique."]'::jsonb,'["Compute row numbers in a derived query.", "Filter the position at the outer level and order the final output explicitly."]'::jsonb,'{"sql": "-- Write your SELECT query here\n"}'::jsonb,'The unique identifier resolves ties for fixed row positions, while the partition restarts selection for each represented department.','{"sql": "SELECT department_id, student_id, score, position FROM (SELECT department_id, student_id, score, ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY department_id ORDER BY score DESC, student_id) AS position FROM results) AS ranked WHERE position <= 2 ORDER BY department_id, position;"}'::jsonb,'The unique identifier resolves ties for fixed row positions, while the partition restarts selection for each represented department.',array['sql'],'CREATE TABLE results (student_id INT PRIMARY KEY, department_id INT NOT NULL, score INT NOT NULL);','INSERT INTO results VALUES (1,10,90),(2,10,90),(3,10,80),(4,20,70),(5,30,50),(6,30,60),(7,30,55);',topic_uuid,parent.status,parent.is_premium,parent.show_on_website,parent.show_on_mobile,0 from public.practice_tests parent where parent.id='pt-dbms-sql-33-window-functions-ranking-and-frames' on conflict(id) do nothing;
